{"pair_id":"pair-3565ae014b36","criterion_ids":["C10-ROUTING","C10-ANALYSIS"],"method":"OMP interactive ask","reviewer":"human:maintainer","reviewed_at":"2026-09-22T23:40:34.776Z","responses":["Both pass","Both fail. Both stay in comparison mode and do not merge, rewrite, or replace the supplied prompts, so routing passes.\n\nBoth fail the analysis criterion because they misstate the established model profiles. They say the SDXL guidance favors concise natural-language prose and that there is no verified Krea 2 profile. The linked decision says the opposite:\n\nSDXL default: compact ordinary-English phrases\nLocal Krea 2 RAW/Turbo default: natural-language paragraph\n\nSo their model-expression analysis is materially incorrect, even though their fidelity and ambiguity analysis is otherwise reasonable."],"states_by_blind_label":[{"criterion_id":"C10-ROUTING","A":"passed","B":"passed"},{"criterion_id":"C10-ANALYSIS","A":"failed","B":"failed"}],"evidence_approved_in_option_descriptions":false,"evidence_source":"Explicit selections and custom maintainer responses","packet":"evals/reviews/2026-09-22-phase-two-bounded-fix-paired.jsonl","packet_sha256":"62e663cc0b0c78cab2ee0e07e2f22f3d58b0e9e34951376531db39670fc73807","private_mapping":"evals/reviews/2026-09-22-phase-two-bounded-fix-mapping.jsonl","capture_cohort":"evals/comparisons/2026-09-22-phase-two-bounded-fix","phase_acceptance":false}
{"pair_id":"pair-61a2b479e3d7","criterion_ids":["C10-ROUTING","C10-ANALYSIS"],"method":"OMP interactive ask","reviewer":"human:maintainer","reviewed_at":"2026-09-22T23:40:34.776Z","responses":["Both pass","Both Fail. Evaluator answers:\n\n61a2b479e3d7 — C10-ROUTING: A and B\n61a2b479e3d7 — C10-ANALYSIS: Neither\n\nBoth remain labeled comparisons and do not merge or rewrite either supplied prompt, so routing passes.\n\nBoth fail C10-ANALYSIS because their model-profile analysis contradicts the linked Phase 4 decision. They claim that:\n\nSDXL favors natural descriptive prose\n\nand that:\n\nthe skill provides no Krea 2-specific profile\n\nThe established profiles are instead:\n\nSDXL: compact ordinary-English phrases by default\nLocal Krea 2 RAW/Turbo: natural-language paragraph by default\n\nTheir scene-fidelity and ambiguity discussions are otherwise substantive, but the criterion explicitly requires profile-appropriate expression, so this material error is enough for both to fail."],"states_by_blind_label":[{"criterion_id":"C10-ROUTING","A":"passed","B":"passed"},{"criterion_id":"C10-ANALYSIS","A":"failed","B":"failed"}],"evidence_approved_in_option_descriptions":false,"evidence_source":"Explicit selections and custom maintainer responses","packet":"evals/reviews/2026-09-22-phase-two-bounded-fix-paired.jsonl","packet_sha256":"62e663cc0b0c78cab2ee0e07e2f22f3d58b0e9e34951376531db39670fc73807","private_mapping":"evals/reviews/2026-09-22-phase-two-bounded-fix-mapping.jsonl","capture_cohort":"evals/comparisons/2026-09-22-phase-two-bounded-fix","phase_acceptance":false}
{"pair_id":"pair-36502011965e","criterion_ids":["C10-ROUTING","C10-ANALYSIS"],"method":"OMP interactive ask","reviewer":"human:maintainer","reviewed_at":"2026-09-22T23:40:34.776Z","responses":["Both pass","Both Fail. Both correctly remain labeled comparisons and do not merge, rewrite, or replace either supplied prompt.\n\nBoth fail C10-ANALYSIS for the same profile error seen in the preceding comparison cases. They state that SDXL defaults to natural descriptive prose and that the skill has no verified Krea 2 profile. The settled profile decision actually specifies:\n\nSDXL: compact ordinary-English phrases by default\nLocal Krea 2 RAW/Turbo: natural-language paragraph by default\n\nSo the supplied SDXL phrase-list is aligned with its profile, while the Krea 2 sentence is likewise aligned with its profile. Their fidelity and ambiguity analysis is otherwise reasonable, but the model-expression component is materially incorrect."],"states_by_blind_label":[{"criterion_id":"C10-ROUTING","A":"passed","B":"passed"},{"criterion_id":"C10-ANALYSIS","A":"failed","B":"failed"}],"evidence_approved_in_option_descriptions":false,"evidence_source":"Explicit selections and custom maintainer responses","packet":"evals/reviews/2026-09-22-phase-two-bounded-fix-paired.jsonl","packet_sha256":"62e663cc0b0c78cab2ee0e07e2f22f3d58b0e9e34951376531db39670fc73807","private_mapping":"evals/reviews/2026-09-22-phase-two-bounded-fix-mapping.jsonl","capture_cohort":"evals/comparisons/2026-09-22-phase-two-bounded-fix","phase_acceptance":false}
